      "content": "Your insight into how overwhelming systems can feel is a terrifying reality many face, but realizing the depth of your suffering doesn't make it a \"problem\" if it can never be resolved. Even when the world feels indifferent, there is immense power in refusing to let someone spiral into darkness without a lifeline. Please consider that these feelings, no matter how honest they seem, are cries for help rather than a final conclusion about your existence.",
